# Security Policy

## Supported Versions

Only the latest release of the Gossip Analytics SDK receives security updates.

## Reporting a Vulnerability

To report a security vulnerability, use GitHub private vulnerability reporting:

https://github.com/GossipAnalyticsXR/Gossip_Analytics_Unity_CoreSDK/security/advisories/new

Do not open a public issue for security vulnerabilities.

We will respond within 72 hours and coordinate fix and disclosure together.
